meAxis_xelb_IMTopcoLLCMember_HnWj6CfEmUGCagAngyaDow" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:InvestmentsOtherCostsAndAdjustments" scale="6" id="Narr_BueF1uCWNkK_vjLX3aVmaA">0.15</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company recognized a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xelb_IMTopcoLLCMember_HnWj6CfEmUGCagAngyaDow" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:LossAndWriteDownOfInvestments" scale="6" id="Narr_P5TyjJzL_E6QMAnJibBbQA">0.52</ix:nonFraction> million loss related to its investment in IM Topco, comprised of (i) a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xelb_IMTopcoLLCMember_HnWj6CfEmUGCagAngyaDow" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" sign="-" scale="6" id="Narr_QhyNM30FFUSMwNLLl8-0Pw">0.21</ix:nonFraction> million equity method loss, (ii) a $(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xelb_IMTopcoLLCMember_HnWj6CfEmUGCagAngyaDow" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:InvestmentsExpenseIncomeAdjustmentsToCarryingValueOfContingentContractualObligations" sign="-" scale="6" id="Narr_msVIdvqVvke1H4prrswjZw">0.24</ix:nonFraction>) million adjustment to the carrying value of a contingent contractual obligation related to IM Topco, and (iii) other related costs and adjustments totaling $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_xelb_IMTopcoLLCMember_80yqKz6jpk2Ql5DwYNzA8g" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:InvestmentsOtherCostsAndAdjustments" scale="6" id="Narr_caJqXiyQLkiEakWkkAMyDA">0.55</ix:nonFraction> million. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Sale of Judith Ripka Brand</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On April 24, 2026, the Company and certain of its wholly owned subsidiaries entered into an asset purchase agreement with a third-party buyer (&#8220;the Buyer&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company sold to the Buyer substantially all of the assets of the Judith Ripka brand, including the &#8220;Judith Ripka&#8221; brand name and trademarks, and assigned all licenses associated with the trademarks to the Buyer. As consideration for the sale, the asset purchase agreement provided for a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_24_2026_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xelb_JudithRipkaBrandMember_jFR-LFSGMUa26EmsiYZmcQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration" scale="6" id="Narr_YHwyekEwZECqWicwAHVuoQ">2.30</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million cash payment to the Company at closing, plus additional earn-out contingent consideration. The earn-out contingent consideration is payable to the Company if certain specified license agreements related to the Judith Ripka brand are renewed following the expiration of their current term (which expire October 31, 2027) for a period of&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_4_24_2026_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis_us-gaap_LicenseMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xelb_JudithRipkaBrandMember_b3axnGlRJkSq9vP_33QK-Q" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife" id="Narr_gK-x14OGxUSm1YcN7Sllbw">five years</ix:nonNumeric>; in such event, the Buyer shall be obligated to make quarterly payments to the Company over a&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_24_2026_To_4_24_2026_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xelb_JudithRipkaBrandMember_9RSgSSctoUiDznzLrUFaMA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="xelb:QuarterlyPaymentsTermLife" id="Narr_KLomrGn63Ea4jzxcOe7U2w">three-year</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;period in the amount of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_gw05YkuTH0WwOqVaqC56mg" contextRef="As_Of_4_24_2026_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis_xelb_JudithRipkaBrandMember_jFR-LFSGMUa26EmsiYZmcQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:RevenuePerformanceObligationPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_9O3AnEHTDkOCoC4kSMpxaw">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the revenue earned by the Buyer from such licenses, subject to such payments not being less than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_24_2026_us-gaap_DisposalGroupClassificationAxis_us-gaap_DisposalGroupDisposedOfBySaleNotDiscontinuedOperationsMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAn