onNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:solid;">Term Loan Debt</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 12, 2024, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries entered into a loan and security agreement with FEAC Agent, LLC (&#8220;FEAC&#8221;), as administrative agent and collateral agent, FEF Distributors, LLC, as lead arranger, and Restore Capital, LLC (&#8220;Restore&#8221;), as agent for certain lenders, pursuant to which the lenders made term loans to the Company and agreed to make additional term loans to the Company upon the satisfaction of a condition precedent described in the loan agreement. The term loans under the loan agreement are as follows: (1) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_ke3molTUPka33-C_HDYNFA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_ndyaJaBlKEyuemg0Xn-55Q">3.95</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Term Loan A&#8221;) was made on the closing date, (2) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember__Y2ORSjRME6ANkQlygGRTQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_5jP6F-CdYEWa3i5emeVMhg">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Term Loan B&#8221;) was made on the closing date, and (3) a term loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_DelayedDrawTermLoanMember_TQeIpQ7BKUGP68IXLtviDA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_hbW4qQ1AgkKBiauw6BUBdg">2.05</ix:nonFraction> million (&#8220;Delayed Draw Term Loan&#8221;; Term Loan A, Term Loan B and Delayed Draw Term Loan are referred to as &#8220;Term Loans&#8221;) was subsequently made in March 2025. A portion of the proceeds from the Delayed Draw Term Loan were deposited in a bank account to satisfy a liquidity covenant in the loan agreement. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Term Loans are guaranteed by certain direct and indirect subsidiaries of the Company, and are secured by all of the assets of the Company and such subsidiaries. The loan agreement contains various customary financial covenants and reporting requirements, as specified and defined therein. The Company was in compliance with all applicable covenants under the loan agreement, or if not in compliance with certain covenants had obtained a waiver from the lenders with respect to such covenants, as of and for all periods presented in the condensed consolidated financial statements. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 21, 2025, the Company and certain of its subsidiaries and its lenders and FEAC entered into an amendment of the December 2024 loan and security agreement, which provided for a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_NewTermLoanDebtMember_Hhnn4EcpjUSemAR3rzhZFg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:LongTermDebtRepaymentToBeMade" scale="6" id="Narr_9Yw-kj2Mtk-9itDpBy_hYA">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million repayment of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_12_2024_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_ke3molTUPka33-C_HDYNFA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_sNXNpbipWke0yp8sr7eRvg">3.95</ix:nonFraction> million Term Loan A and an additional Term Loan B in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_5IrRXUDoKUyXmfFWrglfBw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentAdditionalBorrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_Puy6Q1ECdk6kcOilh2mceA">5.12</ix:nonFraction> million. The term loans outstanding after giving effect to the April 21, 2025 amendment and the application of the proceeds of the additional Term Loan B were as follows: (1) Term Loan A in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_hRLpEJw2RkywnkqdUzy6cA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_m1_sD5l5Wk-yFTg9XdPdGg">4.50</ix:nonFraction> million, and (2) Term Loan B in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_5IrRXUDoKUyXmfFWrglfBw" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_ZJ64Shm540WpMU3XdCxDpQ">9.12</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with the April 2025 amendment and refinancing transaction, UTG Capital, Inc., a Delaware corporation (UTG&#8221;), purchased a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_gw05YkuTH0WwOqVaqC56mg" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_UtgCapitalIncMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xelb_DebtRefinancingApril2025Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_SW2377j0f0OlYxsnU843IQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentParticipationInterest" scale="-2" id="Narr_AslZEIQZkk6lMeuceK_FEQ">100</ix:nonFraction>% undivided, participation interest in Term Loan B for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_30_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_UtgCapitalIncMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xelb_DebtRefinancingApril2025Member_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanbMember_SW2377j0f0OlYxsnU843IQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_yl8oz4nHJEOVKTYCcRrvrA">9.12</ix:nonFraction> million. Also in connection with the refinancing, the Company issued certain warrants to UTG and Restore, and amended certain warrants that had been previously issued in December 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 15, 2025, the Company repaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2025_To_5_15_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_FirstEagleAlternativeCreditLlcMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember__JH4Vbf6HESW4XSy0amZkQ" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_y6D_6hNPB0uKiRqA9APgNw">0.50</ix:nonFraction> million of the outstanding principal amount of Term Loan A. </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">13</p></div></div>
