"ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_A9dsvPMjNU2qNZR5MlAclw">0.5</ix:nonFraction>0 million was changed to be due on December 31, 2026 which shall be held by IPX Capital, LLC (&#8220;IPX&#8221;), a related party. In addition, upon the repayment of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_18_2025_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_v48N0VH7eEWC3_BZ6laR7A" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentObligation" scale="6" id="Narr_AJql-h520kW5BRclQlrHTw">3.25</ix:nonFraction> million of Term Loan A, the Company will have revised financial covenants. The minimum revenue requirement for the rolling 12 months ending December 31, 2025 will be $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_IncludedSubsidiariesMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_Q83Yul30oUuJ_bShnTWIIQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:MinimumRevenueRequirement" scale="6" id="Narr_KoVJtycLBkGIwION13OLlw">3.9</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_CounterpartyNameAxis_xelb_HalstonBrandMember_us-gaap_LongtermDebtTypeAxis_xelb_TermLoanaMember_A3dVJRmUwEa9zG9Nxh22rg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xelb:MinimumRevenueRequirement" scale="6" id="Narr_WUevux748USyd0cT_7aEfQ">1.7</ix:nonFraction> million for the Included Subsidiaries and Halston, respectively, each as defined in the loan agreements. Further, after the Term Loan A payment is made, the minimum revenue requirement covenants shall remain at these levels for the duration of the loans and the minimum liquidity requirement shall be zero, which includes the lenders&#8217; release of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_SeNoRWdIwkmrWeisC2LdDQ" contextRef="As_Of_11_18_2025_EjjdkpFyN0